WEBVTT

00:16.090 --> 00:17.680
Something appeared!

00:19.570 --> 00:21.720
This is terrible! The pool is broken!

00:21.720 --> 00:23.480
Daimidaler appeared!

00:23.480 --> 00:25.270
So have panties.

00:28.300 --> 00:29.620
I won't be indecisive anymore!

00:30.280 --> 00:32.650
I will fight!

00:32.650 --> 00:34.650
It's really been a while.

00:34.960 --> 00:37.200
But, will it be all right?

00:37.200 --> 00:41.910
A Type-6 who has never seen battle and a factor who's had a blank?

00:42.220 --> 00:45.410
Nothing to worry about! Go forth, Kiyuna Kiriko!

00:45.740 --> 00:47.920
Your surprisingly large breasts aren't just for show!

00:48.330 --> 00:51.970
Kiriko, there's no use hiding in such a bandaged up mecha!

00:51.970 --> 00:53.430
Now get her!

00:53.430 --> 00:57.640
Shine! Antarctic Number 11! Your eyes are 10,000 volts!

00:57.640 --> 00:59.620
Antarctic Blaster!

01:06.070 --> 01:08.350
Kiriko-chan!

01:11.180 --> 01:12.760
Jesus wept!

01:12.760 --> 01:14.230
There is nothing left.

01:14.230 --> 01:17.930
Hm? That's strange? The shot was set at a lower power.

01:17.930 --> 01:19.530
Shit! You bastards!

01:20.020 --> 01:21.530
How could you do that to Kiriko-chan?!

01:21.890 --> 01:25.790
You are Penguins! You're all scumbag Penguins!

01:25.790 --> 01:29.330
Hey! We won't forgive you if you talk badly about Penguin-sans.

01:29.330 --> 01:32.290
And, your girlfriend is over there.

01:42.720 --> 01:46.100
I will save Shouma-kun!

01:46.010 --> 01:50.180
{OP First Frame}

01:46.150 --> 01:51.480
Turn that voracious sex drive into strength

01:51.110 --> 01:57.030
Daimidaler the Sound Robot

02:04.460 --> 02:10.130
The darkness is spreading

02:09.790 --> 02:15.550
Why do I keep fighting?

02:15.090 --> 02:26.060
I just don't want to lose these days of peace or the sensation I get to feel with these hands

02:25.770 --> 02:31.570
The sound of moaning gives me power

02:31.020 --> 02:34.150
I won't forgive anyone who tries to take them away

02:39.030 --> 02:44.790
Surge with Hi-ERO particles

02:44.500 --> 02:50.210
Attack when fully charged

03:16.360 --> 03:21.160
Hurrah !Antarctic Number 11 Appears

03:16.360 --> 03:21.160
Episode 07:

03:28.460 --> 03:31.790
Argh, looking down at us from a high place like that!

03:31.790 --> 03:32.960
That makes us so angry!

03:36.210 --> 03:38.800
There's no need to hold back if we're shooting toward the sky!

03:38.800 --> 03:40.590
Shoot at full power!

03:40.590 --> 03:41.470
Understood!

03:41.470 --> 03:43.010
Here goes shot number two!

03:43.010 --> 03:44.510
Antarctic Blaster!

04:04.410 --> 04:05.450
Ouch...

04:05.450 --> 04:07.950
Shouma-kun, are you all right?

04:07.950 --> 04:09.080
Kiriko-chan.

04:12.420 --> 04:14.540
With a high power of 800 megawatts,

04:14.540 --> 04:17.090
it surpasses Type-2 in performance and speed.

04:17.090 --> 04:19.590
This is Daimidaler Type-6, Kiriko!

04:22.010 --> 04:23.640
It-It's super strong!

04:23.640 --> 04:24.970
What should we do, Ritz?

04:24.970 --> 04:27.600
O-Of course we continue our mission!

04:27.600 --> 04:30.600
No! You must retreat, Ritz!

04:30.600 --> 04:32.100
But, Your Highness!

04:32.440 --> 04:34.270
We can still fight!

04:34.270 --> 04:37.610
We need to repay them for hurting Antarctic Number 11!

04:38.030 --> 04:41.780
No. Antarctic Number 11 is not made for battle.

04:41.780 --> 04:43.110
You must return quickly!

04:46.330 --> 04:48.200
Remember us, Kiriko!

04:48.200 --> 04:50.620
We'll repay this debt three times over when we meet again!

04:59.670 --> 05:00.670
Shouma-kun!

05:06.560 --> 05:08.560
Those two again!

05:08.930 --> 05:13.100
Shouma-kun, there is one other thing I was hiding.

05:13.100 --> 05:13.810
Huh?

05:14.730 --> 05:20.280
I'm sorry. Actually, I used to be a pilot for Daimidaler.

05:20.280 --> 05:21.570
For Daimidaler...

05:22.450 --> 05:25.530
I wanted to be normal.

05:25.530 --> 05:30.080
I wanted to be a normal student and date you, Shouma-kun.

05:30.330 --> 05:32.870
But, Shouma-kun, you ended up...

05:36.630 --> 05:37.880
That's enough.

05:37.880 --> 05:38.420
Huh?

05:38.920 --> 05:43.090
Actually, I don't really understand anything about robots and Penguins.

05:43.090 --> 05:45.340
But I do know one thing.

05:46.010 --> 05:49.970
I want to be with you, Kiriko-chan. I want to help you.

05:51.060 --> 05:54.850
Even if I get chased by Penguins or captured and toyed with,

05:54.850 --> 05:56.730
I don't care at all.

05:57.310 --> 06:00.820
It's much better than letting you fight alone, Kiriko-chan.

06:01.650 --> 06:03.320
Shouma-kun.

06:05.320 --> 06:07.320
I'll fight together with you.

06:08.070 --> 06:08.870
Yes.

06:23.760 --> 06:26.840
Idiot! M-My promotion!

06:28.390 --> 06:32.350
These two and their ability to be lovey-dovey in public...

06:32.810 --> 06:37.600
Now that Madanbashi is gone, they may become the saviors of our world!

06:38.560 --> 06:40.110
But, they're annoying!

06:41.110 --> 06:43.110
A new Daimidaler.

06:44.190 --> 06:47.200
It may hinder our plans.

06:47.780 --> 06:49.370
We must take care of it immediately.

06:52.790 --> 06:53.790
Administrator.

06:53.790 --> 06:54.540
What?

06:55.290 --> 06:59.920
Why me? There are still two other Factors.

06:59.920 --> 07:02.420
Of course there are other candidates for this.

07:02.420 --> 07:06.050
But you were chosen for a specific reason.

07:07.300 --> 07:10.970
The current Factors that Beauty Salon Prince possesses are:

07:10.970 --> 07:15.480
Kiyuna Kiriko, Touma Hozomi, Haebaru Ryosuke.

07:15.480 --> 07:18.810
In the Japanese alphabet, your name is first!

07:19.230 --> 07:20.650
A reason like that?!

07:20.650 --> 07:23.900
Well. Whatever the reason, welcome back, Kiyuna-chan.

07:23.900 --> 07:26.440
Long time! How are you?

07:26.440 --> 07:30.030
I'm sorry for causing you so much trouble.

07:30.030 --> 07:31.740
Please take care of me again.

07:31.740 --> 07:33.660
Well, you'll just have to pay us back later.

07:33.990 --> 07:36.000
You mean in bed?

07:36.000 --> 07:37.830
B-Be quiet!

07:40.790 --> 07:43.170
You all haven't changed at all.

07:43.170 --> 07:45.840
Wh-Who are these people?!

07:45.840 --> 07:48.550
Kiriko-chan was working in a place like this?

07:49.970 --> 07:52.640
So, you're Kiyuna-chan's boyfriend?

07:52.640 --> 07:55.180
Y-Yes! My name is Ameku Shouma!

07:55.180 --> 07:58.310
Ask us if there's anything you don't know.

07:58.310 --> 08:00.230
No, uh...

08:00.230 --> 08:01.900
What's wrong, Shouma-kun?

08:01.900 --> 08:03.570
It-It's nothing!

08:03.570 --> 08:07.740
This is the first time I've been to a secret base and there's a lot to see!

08:07.740 --> 08:10.160
Goodness, you can't do that.

08:10.160 --> 08:13.160
Shouma-kun, you only need to look at me.

08:13.160 --> 08:14.950
Th-That's right!

08:14.950 --> 08:16.330
Shouma-kun.

08:17.870 --> 08:19.250
Kiriko-chan.

08:20.120 --> 08:21.880
These guys are really funny!

08:21.880 --> 08:24.540
They're a completely different type from Kouichi-kun.

08:22.210 --> 08:23.330
Shouma-kun.

08:23.330 --> 08:24.340
Kiriko-chan.

08:24.540 --> 08:28.010
We're going to have to make a lot of changes to the cockpit.

08:28.010 --> 08:31.470
Hm. What about "We Entered A Love Hotel

08:28.010 --> 08:30.380
You're too nice, Shouma-kun!

08:30.380 --> 08:31.470
Kiriko-chan.

08:31.470 --> 08:34.100
To Get Away From the Rain, Oh My" mode?

08:40.310 --> 08:43.270
A tuned up Antarctic Number 11.

08:43.610 --> 08:46.980
You will be able to fight on the same level as Daimidaler.

08:47.320 --> 08:51.570
And the main cornerstone of this operation will be...

09:06.880 --> 09:08.760
You, Ritz!

09:13.470 --> 09:14.890
Who is that?

09:14.890 --> 09:16.680
Looks dangerous.

09:18.430 --> 09:22.890
The number you have dialed is currently out of range

09:22.890 --> 09:25.730
or powered off and cannot be reached.

09:25.730 --> 09:26.270
So late!

09:26.270 --> 09:27.520
Matayoshi-san!

09:27.520 --> 09:30.530
If you'd like to leave a message, please do so after the beep.

09:32.650 --> 09:36.320
If you're going to be late, why don't you at least tell me?!

09:36.320 --> 09:40.750
Think of me, who is taking you to and from school!

09:40.750 --> 09:45.330
I'm sorry. But our school doesn't allow cell phones. And...

09:46.840 --> 09:50.380
We should follow school rules properly, right?

09:50.380 --> 09:53.470
Sorry, because I can't bend the rules,

09:53.470 --> 09:55.130
I'm causing you trouble, Kiriko-chan.

09:55.130 --> 09:58.350
But, I love that serious side of you, Shouma-kun!

09:58.350 --> 09:59.430
Kiriko-chan.

09:59.430 --> 10:00.600
Shouma-kun.

10:00.600 --> 10:01.850
Kiriko-chan.

10:01.850 --> 10:02.980
Shouma-kun.

10:02.140 --> 10:02.980
<i>So annoying.</i>

10:09.150 --> 10:10.610
A Penguin robot?!

10:27.210 --> 10:30.420
If we fight here, we'll be able to minimize the damage!

10:37.340 --> 10:39.600
What are you doing, Daimidaler?!

10:39.600 --> 10:41.260
It really is a nuisance!

10:42.270 --> 10:46.020
It's like a private room for ourselves.

10:46.020 --> 10:48.730
I can't believe it came again!

10:48.730 --> 10:51.270
This time, I'm going to grind you into the dust!

10:51.270 --> 10:54.530
Hmph! It won't be that easy!

10:54.530 --> 10:59.410
Antarctic Number 11 has been revamped for Daimidaler.

10:59.410 --> 11:01.490
You're going to cry like a baby!

11:01.490 --> 11:04.290
Here I come, Penguin Empire!

11:07.040 --> 11:08.210
Barrier!

11:09.330 --> 11:10.500
Barrier!

11:11.340 --> 11:12.460
No way!

11:15.590 --> 11:17.340
That barrier is a problem.

11:17.340 --> 11:19.590
It's such a solid cock blocker!

11:19.590 --> 11:21.010
Hey! Goodness!

11:22.220 --> 11:26.230
Kiriko, that attack was so straightforward that it's boring me to death.

11:26.640 --> 11:31.310
At this rate, you'll never be able
to beat the improved Antarctic 11

11:31.310 --> 11:33.230
which has been loaded with our personal battle data!

11:33.690 --> 11:36.990
Well then, it's our turn to repay you three times over!

11:42.450 --> 11:45.200
Go! Antarctic Number 11!

11:56.050 --> 11:57.170
So fast!

12:04.970 --> 12:09.480
How is it? This is our special attack, Penguin Aurora Spin!

12:09.480 --> 12:12.480
We'll show you the result of many sleepless nights spent

12:12.480 --> 12:14.230
perfecting our Penguin figure skating!

12:14.230 --> 12:16.530
That's not all! Since it's an independent robot,

12:16.530 --> 12:19.570
there will be no morning Ritzness no matter how much it spins!

12:19.570 --> 12:22.450
Although I feel that is a bit of shame, personally.

12:22.450 --> 12:25.990
This is where the fun starts! It's show time!

12:26.330 --> 12:27.660
Ouch.

12:27.660 --> 12:29.210
Shouma-kun, are you all right?!

12:29.210 --> 12:30.960
I-I'm fine. This isn't much!

12:51.940 --> 12:54.810
I'll move the Hi-ERO particles of Type-6 to the defense system.

12:54.810 --> 12:57.150
We'll be able to protect ourselves for a little while that way.

12:57.150 --> 12:59.820
But, if you do that, how will you defeat it?

12:59.820 --> 13:00.820
Well...

13:01.610 --> 13:02.660
Get all lovey-dovey!

13:03.450 --> 13:05.490
Get more and more lovey-dovey!

13:05.490 --> 13:07.410
Continue your immoral public acts at full power

13:07.410 --> 13:09.910
and produce Hi-ERO particles!

13:09.910 --> 13:10.870
If you do,

13:10.870 --> 13:14.290
you'll be able to trigger Daimidaler Type-6's special attack!

13:14.290 --> 13:16.960
There is no other way to defeat it!

13:16.960 --> 13:17.880
Yes!

13:18.380 --> 13:20.260
Shouma-kun, please.

13:20.260 --> 13:22.340
Do whatever you want to my body!

13:22.340 --> 13:23.380
What?!

13:23.380 --> 13:26.510
This is no time to hesitate, Ameku Shouma!

13:26.510 --> 13:30.100
The special attack needs a massive amount of Hi-ERO particles!

13:30.100 --> 13:34.270
In other words, you must do perverted things to Kiyuna Kiriko!

13:34.270 --> 13:35.400
There's no need to hold back!

13:36.610 --> 13:45.490
Tear her sweet body apart like a proper boy going through puberty!

13:45.490 --> 13:48.200
Tell him as well, Kiyuna Kiriko!

13:48.200 --> 13:48.990
Yes!

13:49.620 --> 13:53.160
Shouma-kun, you can mess me up completely.

13:53.750 --> 13:55.790
Good job, Kiyuna Kiriko!

13:55.790 --> 13:57.670
Oh, yes, I just said what came to mind.

13:57.670 --> 13:58.960
Go forth as such!

13:58.960 --> 13:59.750
Yes!

14:00.170 --> 14:02.550
No way! This is a lie!

14:02.550 --> 14:04.590
My Kiriko-chan wouldn't do something like this!

14:05.180 --> 14:07.890
That pure and innocent Kiriko-chan!

14:08.890 --> 14:09.970
It's my fault!

14:10.310 --> 14:12.730
It's because I did so many things so light-heartedly!

14:13.350 --> 14:15.940
I-I don't want this.

14:16.230 --> 14:18.610
No, I don't want this!

14:18.610 --> 14:19.360
What?!

14:19.360 --> 14:22.610
I won't do perverted things to Kiriko-chan anymore!

14:22.610 --> 14:24.400
Are you an idiot?!

14:24.400 --> 14:26.410
This guy is incredibly troublesome!

14:26.410 --> 14:30.580
He's the type that can only input angels or bitches in his head.

14:30.580 --> 14:32.750
What are you thinking, Shouma-kun?!

14:32.750 --> 14:35.120
How else do you plan on getting through this?!

14:35.120 --> 14:36.620
Well, um, that is...

14:38.000 --> 14:42.630
What, giving up already? But we won't stop the attack!

14:42.630 --> 14:46.630
Special attack! Penguin Aurora Spin!

14:53.390 --> 14:56.690
My pinpoint front tail! Do it!

14:57.560 --> 14:59.650
Spin my front-tail!

14:59.650 --> 15:02.400
Super Spin, Antarctic Blaster!

15:10.070 --> 15:12.240
Hot dog! We got them!

15:12.910 --> 15:14.160
Kiriko-chan!

15:15.710 --> 15:17.920
I don't want to do any more perverted things to her!

15:17.920 --> 15:22.000
But, at this rate, Kiriko-chan will... what should I do?

15:22.000 --> 15:26.260
How can I make Kiriko-chan excited without touching her?

15:26.260 --> 15:27.590
That's right!

15:28.010 --> 15:29.640
Kiriko-chan, look at me!

15:29.640 --> 15:30.090
Huh?!

15:33.470 --> 15:37.730
Father's special skill, Gulliver Stick!

15:55.330 --> 15:59.000
Daimidaler Type-6, Kiriko. Chakra generators, all green!

15:59.370 --> 16:01.710
Hi-ERO particles are in full burst mode.

16:01.710 --> 16:06.710
You did it, Ameku Shouma! That was a great Gulliver Stick!

16:06.710 --> 16:10.220
We did it! Now, Let's fight back, Kiriko-chan!

16:13.550 --> 16:14.640
Kiriko-chan?

16:14.970 --> 16:18.730
You don't know when to quit! We'll tear you apart with this!

16:22.520 --> 16:26.230
Hi-ERO particle levels are fluctuating rapidly between 0 and 200.

16:26.230 --> 16:28.030
The numbers aren't stabilizing.

16:28.030 --> 16:30.860
Something has happened to her!

16:30.860 --> 16:36.120
Kiyuna Kiriko, did you get dizzy because of his stick?

16:36.120 --> 16:36.990
What?!

16:37.620 --> 16:42.120
She's gone into shock from Ameku Shouma's Gulliver Stick.

16:42.120 --> 16:43.540
Kiriko-chan.

16:43.540 --> 16:49.380
I'm sorry. Looking at Shouma-kun's
Gulliver Stick seems to have been too strong.

16:49.380 --> 16:52.260
Th-That's a fake! It isn't real!

16:52.890 --> 16:53.970
I know.

16:53.970 --> 16:59.430
I know, but... but I can't take it!

17:05.480 --> 17:08.730
Although it puts Daimidaler Type-6 into full burst,

17:08.730 --> 17:11.860
it drops Kiyuna Kiriko's will to fight.

17:11.860 --> 17:16.160
The Gulliver Stick is a double-edged sword!

17:16.160 --> 17:17.030
I'll do it!

17:17.030 --> 17:18.040
What?

17:18.740 --> 17:22.370
I'm the one who made Kiriko-chan this way! It's my responsibility!

17:22.370 --> 17:24.210
So I'll do something about it!

17:24.210 --> 17:26.290
A novice like you?!

17:26.750 --> 17:27.960
Please!

17:27.960 --> 17:29.300
Fine! Try and do it!

17:30.010 --> 17:34.300
Oh? Still going to fight? You will never learn will you?

17:36.800 --> 17:39.890
I'll protect Kiriko-chan!

17:39.890 --> 17:42.180
Eat this! Gulliver Punch!

17:42.770 --> 17:43.640
Barrier!

17:48.230 --> 17:49.820
Huh? That wasn't a punch!

17:49.820 --> 17:51.530
What?!

17:51.530 --> 17:53.070
His front tail broke!

17:53.070 --> 17:55.280
Gulliver Kick!

17:55.280 --> 17:56.660
Barrier!

17:58.780 --> 18:00.660
S-Sorry!

18:00.660 --> 18:02.580
That's so dirty, Daimidaler!

18:02.580 --> 18:04.920
Liar! Cheater! Idiot! Premature ejaculator!

18:04.920 --> 18:07.420
Shit! This is why we hate humans!

18:07.840 --> 18:09.800
This is what they mean by "so bad, it's good."

18:09.800 --> 18:11.420
This is truly a slot machine play!

18:11.420 --> 18:13.880
Rikantz Seaberry's so called excellent data

18:13.880 --> 18:15.800
is meaningless against a novice!

18:16.800 --> 18:21.140
Shouma-kun is so cool!

18:23.680 --> 18:27.100
Thank you, Shouma-kun. I'm all right now.

18:27.100 --> 18:29.400
Kiriko-chan, thank goodness!

18:29.980 --> 18:32.030
Do it, Kiyuna Kiriko!

18:32.030 --> 18:35.070
It's time to show them the true power of Type-6!

18:35.070 --> 18:37.370
Yes! Let's do it, Shouma-kun!

18:37.370 --> 18:38.070
Yeah!

18:38.070 --> 18:40.080
Please follow my lead!

18:40.080 --> 18:41.240
Got it!

18:41.240 --> 18:45.500
Leg panel, turn the secondary knob, climb power on!

18:45.500 --> 18:50.170
Auto throttle on! Pedestal aerial control unit, AFS off!

18:50.170 --> 18:54.840
Loading navigational target display from the aerial information terminal!

19:17.490 --> 19:21.580
Complete! Daimidaler Type-6 particles! Disguise!

19:21.580 --> 19:22.870
They did it!

19:23.330 --> 19:26.370
No kidding! They can transform, too

19:26.370 --> 19:30.080
That huge arm. The scraggly hair. What a hideous form!

19:30.080 --> 19:33.340
That looks a lot more like Daimidaler.

19:33.340 --> 19:36.170
But, that form is gimmicky and cool!

19:36.170 --> 19:37.380
Isn't this bad?

19:37.380 --> 19:40.930
Not yet! Antarctic Number 11, body slam!

19:40.930 --> 19:44.770
Use the last of your power and go!

19:52.520 --> 19:54.150
Together, with Kiriko-chan!

19:54.570 --> 19:56.150
With Shouma-kun!

20:07.080 --> 20:10.370
Daimidaler CP Slash!

20:19.510 --> 20:24.100
Antarctic Number 11!

20:50.330 --> 20:52.210
We did it! Shouma-kun!

20:52.210 --> 20:54.080
We did it! Kiriko-chan!

20:54.080 --> 20:58.590
You were so cool! I've fallen in love with you all over again!

20:56.250 --> 20:57.960
These two can do it.

20:58.590 --> 21:01.050
You're the one that's truly amazing.

20:58.590 --> 21:01.050
They can pilot the new Daimidaler.

21:01.050 --> 21:03.340
You're so brave for going against such a scary robot,

21:01.050 --> 21:03.340
They can defeat the Penguin Empire!

21:03.340 --> 21:05.470
Kiriko-chan, and defeating the Penguin Empire!

21:05.470 --> 21:07.520
No, Shouma-kun, you're the brave one.

21:06.390 --> 21:09.350
They're annoying!

21:07.520 --> 21:08.720
Kiriko-chan! Even so!

21:08.720 --> 21:09.810
Shouma-kun!

21:09.350 --> 21:11.140
Seriously annoying!

21:09.810 --> 21:11.140
Kiriko-chan!

21:11.140 --> 21:12.770
This is somehow funny.

21:11.690 --> 21:15.480
These two should just die!

21:12.770 --> 21:14.020
You're right.

21:19.030 --> 21:23.610
A new hero is born. Lovey-dovey Kiriko!

21:24.450 --> 21:25.910
Let yourself go a little, Shouma!

21:26.490 --> 21:29.200
The declining population problem is depending on you two!

21:29.790 --> 21:31.460
Don't go berserk, Matayoshi.

21:31.830 --> 21:35.670
Fight, Daimidaler!

21:41.380 --> 21:44.300
Don't get so cocky, Beauty Salon Prince.

21:44.800 --> 21:47.300
Our victory has already been decided!

21:58.520 --> 21:59.650
Leave it to us

21:59.110 --> 22:01.110
Love love li-li-links

22:00.690 --> 22:01.860
